  "agreementAccept": "Accept and continue",
  "agreementMessage": "About the app\nDITING is an open-source tool focused on local DNS resolution optimisation and network rule filtering. It offers three work modes: Normal (full-tunnel control), Turbo (a lightweight pure-Kotlin narrow route) and Standalone server (a LAN service that needs no VPN). Everything runs locally on the device: no remote data upload and no privacy tracking.\n\nHow it works\nNormal and Turbo modes take over DNS resolution through the Android local VPN interface and never connect to a remote VPN server; Standalone server mode needs no VPN permission and listens on local port 1053 for LAN devices. Rules and logs stay on the device. Please understand the impact before enabling advanced extensions.\n\nDisclaimer\nThis software is provided as is. Users must comply with applicable laws and verify the legality and safety of the rules and upstream resolvers they configure. Any illegal use is strictly forbidden, and users bear all consequences of their own configuration or use of this software.",
